{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>在11月17日舉辦的長鑫科技2026第三季度業績説明會上，總裁曹堪宇對外披露客户長協與下一代4F² DRAM架構的最新進展。</strong>面對AI帶來的存儲結構性增長，公司正通過長期供貨協議鎖定中長期訂單，新一代技術的大規模量產時間並不預設固定節點，將跟隨客户驗證進度推進。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586914.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.120647+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:39:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:36.076973+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:36.076973+00:00","content_hash":"305753d0abd817216bbcc31453d75292182cc326056e492d01c9f76558191ddb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}